{"type": "tool_call", "toolName": "write_file", "toolCallId": "call_00_QK9jAmSPdlC8M5OXEQaS4537", "requestId": "9d71ab06-6752-4e20-9d65-46dd884b8aae", "runId": "44463f6d-ffa", "seq": 2, "toolInput": "{\"path\":\"knowledge/questions/total_sales.yml\",\"reason\":\"登记必验常用问题「2025年有效订单销售额」，含已确认口径与单条 SELECT 查询\",\"content\":\"id: total_sales\\nquestion: 2025年有效订单销售额是多少？\\ndefinition: >-\\n  统计 2025 自然年（order_time 在 2025-01-01 00:00:00 至 2025-12-31 23:59:59 之间）\\n  的有效订单销售额。有效订单指 status 为 PAID 或 COMPLETED、且 is_deleted = 0 的订单。\\n  销售额为订单金额合计，amount_cents 单位为分，需除以 100 换算为元，不扣除退款，\\n  不需要关联客户表。\\nsql: >-\\n  SELECT SUM(amount_cents) / 100 AS total_sales\\n  FROM \\\"order\\\"\\n  WHERE order_time >= DATE_TRUNC('year', DATE '2025-01-01')\\n    AND order_time < DATE_TRUNC('year', DATE '2025-01-01') + INTERVAL 1 YEAR\\n    AND status IN ('PAID', 'COMPLETED')\\n    AND is_deleted = 0\\nrequired: true\\n\"}"}
